    "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ Displays: footnote of Add extra brightness only near full brightness",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La brillantor extra s’esvaeix a mesura que abaixes la brillantor de la pantalla, de manera que les tecles de brillantor mantenen el seu interval normal. Desactiva aquesta opció per multiplicar qualsevol brillantor."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Extra jas slábne, když snižujete jas monitoru, takže klávesy jasu si zachovají běžný rozsah. Chcete‑li násobit jakýkoli jas, tuto volbu vypněte."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den ekstra lysstyrke aftager, når du skruer ned for skærmens lysstyrke, så lysstyrketasterne beholder deres normale område. Slå dette fra for at forstærke enhver lysstyrke."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Zusatzhelligkeit nimmt ab, wenn du die Displayhelligkeit verringerst, sodass die Helligkeitstasten ihren normalen Bereich behalten. Deaktiviere dies, um jede Helligkeit zu verstärken."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Η επιπλέον φωτεινότητα σβήνει σταδιακά καθώς χαμηλώνετε τη φωτεινότητα της οθόνης, ώστε τα πλήκτρα φωτεινότητας να διατηρούν το κανονικό τους εύρος. Απενεργοποιήστε την επιλογή για να πολλαπλασιάζεται οποιαδήποτε φωτεινότητα."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El brillo extra se desvanece a medida que bajas el brillo de la pantalla, así que las teclas de brillo mantienen su rango normal. Desactiva esta opción para multiplicar cualquier brillo."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lisäkirkkaus hiipuu, kun lasket näytön kirkkautta, joten kirkkausnäppäimet toimivat tavallisella alueellaan. Laita tämä pois päältä, jos haluat vahvistaa mitä tahansa kirkkautta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La luminosité supplémentaire s’estompe quand vous baissez la luminosité de l’écran, ce qui préserve la plage normale des touches de luminosité. Désactivez cette option pour multiplier n’importe quelle luminosité."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dodatna svjetlina postupno nestaje kad smanjujete svjetlinu zaslona, pa tipke za svjetlinu zadržavaju uobičajeni raspon. Isključite ovo da biste pojačali bilo koju svjetlinu."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A kijelző fényerejének csökkentésével az extra fényerő fokozatosan megszűnik, így a fényerőgombok megtartják a szokásos tartományukat. Kapcsolja ki, ha bármilyen fényerőt fel szeretne erősíteni."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La luminosità extra si riduce man mano che abbassi la luminosità dello schermo, così i tasti della luminosità mantengono il loro intervallo normale. Disattiva questa opzione per moltiplicare qualsiasi luminosità."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ekstra lysstyrke avtar når du senker lysstyrken på skjermen, så lysstyrketastene beholder sitt vanlige område. Slå av dette for å forsterke lysstyrken på alle nivåer."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Extra helderheid neemt geleidelijk af als je de helderheid van het beeldscherm verlaagt, zodat de helderheidstoetsen hun normale bereik houden. Schakel dit uit om elke helderheid te vermenigvuldigen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dodatkowa jasność stopniowo zanika, gdy zmniejszasz jasność wyświetlacza, więc klawisze jasności działają w zwykłym zakresie. Wyłącz, aby wzmacniać każdą jasność."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O brilho extra diminui conforme você abaixa o brilho da tela, então as teclas de brilho mantêm a faixa normal. Desative esta opção para multiplicar qualquer brilho."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O brilho extra diminui gradualmente à medida que baixa o brilho do monitor, por isso as teclas de brilho mantêm o intervalo normal. Desative esta opção para multiplicar qualquer nível de brilho."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luminozitatea suplimentară scade treptat pe măsură ce reduceți luminozitatea afișajului, astfel încât tastele de luminozitate își păstrează intervalul normal. Dezactivați opțiunea pentru a amplifica orice luminozitate."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При снижении яркости дисплея дополнительная яркость постепенно сходит на нет, поэтому клавиши яркости работают в обычном диапазоне. Выключите, чтобы усиливать любую яркость."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Extra jas slabne, keď znižujete jas displeja, takže klávesy jasu si zachovajú bežný rozsah. Ak chcete násobiť akýkoľvek jas, túto funkciu vypnite."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dodatna svetlost pojenja, ko zmanjšujete svetlost zaslona, zato tipke za svetlost ohranijo običajni razpon. Če želite pomnožiti katero koli svetlost, to možnost izklopite."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den extra ljusstyrkan avtar när du sänker skärmens ljusstyrka, så att ljusstyrketangenterna behåller sitt vanliga omfång. Stäng av det här för att förstärka all ljusstyrka."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ekran parlaklığını düşürdükçe ek parlaklık azalarak kaybolur; böylece parlaklık tuşları normal aralıklarını korur. Ek parlaklığın her parlaklık düzeyinde uygulanması için bunu kapatın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Коли ви зменшуєте яскравість дисплея, додаткова яскравість поступово зникає, тож клавіші яскравості працюють у звичайному діапазоні. Вимкніть, щоб підсилювати будь-яку яскравість."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Extra brightness fades out as you lower the display brightness, so the brightness keys keep their normal range. Turn this off to multiply any brightness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
