    "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked." : {
      "comment" : "Self-test: what the test does, before it runs",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durant aproximadament un minut per pantalla, l’Overbright desbloqueja el marge extra i registra com respon el macOS. La brillantor no canvia, però pot aparèixer un punt minúscul en un racó de la pantalla que s’està provant. Mantén el Mac actiu i desbloquejat."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright na každém monitoru zhruba na minutu zpřístupní rezervu jasu a zaznamená, jak macOS reaguje. Jas se nezmění, ale v rohu testovaného monitoru se může objevit malá tečka. Nenechte Mac přejít do režimu spánku a nezamykejte ho."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I ca. et minut pr. skærm låser Overbright lysreserven op og registrerer, hvordan macOS reagerer. Din lysstyrke ændres ikke, men en lille prik kan dukke op i et hjørne af den skærm, der testes. Hold din Mac vågen og ulåst."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright erschließt auf jedem Display etwa eine Minute lang die Helligkeitsreserve und zeichnet auf, wie macOS reagiert. Deine Helligkeit ändert sich nicht, aber in einer Ecke des getesteten Displays kann ein winziger Punkt erscheinen. Halte deinen Mac wach und entsperrt."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Για περίπου ένα λεπτό ανά οθόνη, το Overbright ξεκλειδώνει το περιθώριο φωτεινότητας και καταγράφει πώς αποκρίνεται το macOS. Η φωτεινότητά σας δεν αλλάζει, αλλά μια μικροσκοπική κουκκίδα μπορεί να εμφανιστεί σε μια γωνία της οθόνης που ελέγχεται. Κρατήστε το Mac σας ξύπνιο και ξεκλείδωτο."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante aproximadamente un minuto por pantalla, Overbright desbloquea el margen de brillo y registra cómo responde macOS. Tu brillo no cambia, pero puede aparecer un punto diminuto en una esquina de la pantalla que se está probando. Mantén el Mac activo y desbloqueado."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright avaa kirkkausvaran noin minuutiksi kullakin näytöllä ja tallentaa, miten macOS reagoi. Kirkkaus ei muutu, mutta testattavan näytön kulmaan voi ilmestyä pieni piste. Pidä Mac hereillä ja lukitsemattomana."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendant environ une minute par écran, Overbright libère la marge de luminosité et enregistre la réaction de macOS. Votre luminosité ne change pas, mais un petit point peut apparaître dans un coin de l’écran testé. Gardez votre Mac éveillé et déverrouillé."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oko minute po zaslonu Overbright otključava rezervu svjetline i bilježi kako macOS reagira. Svjetlina se ne mijenja, ali u kutu zaslona koji se testira može se pojaviti sitna točka. Neka Mac ostane budan i otključan."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az Overbright kijelzőnként körülbelül egy percig feloldja a fényerőtartalékot, és rögzíti, hogyan reagál a macOS. A fényerő nem változik, de a vizsgált kijelző egyik sarkában egy apró pont jelenhet meg. Tartsa a Macet ébren és feloldva."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per circa un minuto per schermo, Overbright sblocca il margine di luminosità e registra come risponde macOS. La luminosità non cambia, ma in un angolo dello schermo in prova potrebbe comparire un puntino. Tieni il Mac attivo e sbloccato."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I omtrent ett minutt per skjerm låser Overbright opp lysreserven og registrerer hvordan macOS reagerer. Lysstyrken endres ikke, men en bitteliten prikk kan vises i et hjørne av skjermen som testes. Hold Macen våken og ulåst."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright ontgrendelt ongeveer een minuut per beeldscherm het extra bereik en legt vast hoe macOS reageert. Je helderheid verandert niet, maar er kan een piepklein puntje verschijnen in een hoek van het beeldscherm dat wordt getest. Houd je Mac wakker en ontgrendeld."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Przez około minutę na każdy wyświetlacz Overbright odblokowuje zapas jasności i zapisuje, jak reaguje macOS. Jasność się nie zmienia, ale w rogu testowanego wyświetlacza może pojawić się maleńka kropka. Nie pozwól Macowi przejść w stan uśpienia i nie blokuj go."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante cerca de um minuto por tela, o Overbright libera a margem de brilho e registra como o macOS responde. O brilho não muda, mas um pontinho pode aparecer em um canto da tela em teste. Mantenha o Mac ativo e desbloqueado."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante cerca de um minuto por monitor, o Overbright desbloqueia a margem extra e regista como o macOS responde. O brilho não muda, mas pode aparecer um pequeno ponto num canto do monitor em teste. Mantenha o Mac ativo e desbloqueado."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Timp de aproximativ un minut pentru fiecare afișaj, Overbright deblochează rezerva de luminozitate și înregistrează cum răspunde macOS. Luminozitatea nu se schimbă, dar un punct minuscul poate apărea într‑un colț al afișajului testat. Mențineți Mac‑ul activ și deblocat."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright по очереди открывает запас яркости каждого дисплея (около минуты на дисплей) и записывает, как реагирует macOS. Яркость не изменится, но в углу проверяемого дисплея может появиться крошечная точка. Не давайте Mac уйти в режим сна и не блокируйте его."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright na každom displeji približne na minútu sprístupní rezervu jasu a zaznamená, ako macOS reaguje. Jas sa nezmení, ale v rohu testovaného displeja sa môže objaviť malá bodka. Nenechajte Mac prejsť do režimu spánku a nezamykajte ho."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright na vsakem zaslonu za približno minuto sprosti rezervo svetlosti in beleži, kako se odzove macOS. Svetlost se ne spremeni, v kotu preizkušanega zaslona pa se lahko prikaže drobna pika. Mac naj medtem ne preide v stanje mirovanja in naj ostane odklenjen."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I ungefär en minut per skärm låser Overbright upp ljusreserven och registrerar hur macOS reagerar. Ljusstyrkan ändras inte, men en liten prick kan synas i ett hörn av skärmen som testas. Håll din Mac vaken och upplåst."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright her ekran için yaklaşık bir dakika boyunca parlaklık payını açar ve macOS’in nasıl yanıt verdiğini kaydeder. Parlaklığınız değişmez, ancak test edilen ekranın bir köşesinde küçük bir nokta görünebilir. Mac’inizi uyanık ve kilidi açık tutun."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright по черзі відкриває запас яскравості кожного дисплея (близько хвилини на дисплей) і записує, як реагує macOS. Яскравість не зміниться, але в кутку дисплея, що перевіряється, може зʼявитися крихітна точка. Не давайте Mac перейти в режим сну й не блокуйте його."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For about a minute per display, Overbright unlocks extra range and records how macOS responds. Your brightness doesn’t change, but a tiny dot may appear in a corner of the display being tested. Keep your Mac awake and unlocked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For two seconds the squares are shown much brighter. Can you still tell the two squares on the right apart?" : {
      "comment" : "Calibration: question of step 3",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "For two seconds the squares are shown much brighter. Can you still tell the two squares on the right apart?"
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durant dos segons, els quadrats es mostren molt més brillants. Encara pots distingir els dos quadrats de la dreta?"
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na dvě sekundy se čtverce zobrazí mnohem jasněji. Rozeznáte pořád oba čtverce vpravo?"
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I to sekunder vises firkanterne meget lysere. Kan du stadig se forskel på de to firkanter til højre?"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Sekunden lang werden die Quadrate viel heller angezeigt. Kannst du die beiden rechten Quadrate noch unterscheiden?"
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Για δύο δευτερόλεπτα τα τετράγωνα εμφανίζονται πολύ φωτεινότερα. Μπορείτε ακόμα να ξεχωρίσετε τα δύο τετράγωνα στα δεξιά;"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante dos segundos, los cuadrados se muestran con mucho más brillo. ¿Sigues distinguiendo los dos cuadrados de la derecha?"
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neliöt näytetään kahden sekunnin ajan paljon kirkkaampina. Erotatko yhä kaksi oikeanpuoleista neliötä toisistaan?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
