    "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ General: text of the question before hiding the menu bar icon; the placeholder is the live key caps of the on/off shortcut",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Encara pots obrir l’Overbright des del Finder o l’Spotlight, i se’n mostrarà la configuració, o fer servir %@ per activar‑lo o desactivar‑lo. Per sortir, torna a obrir l’Overbright i fes clic a “Surt de l’Overbright” a la configuració."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright můžete dál otevřít z Finderu nebo pomocí Spotlightu, čímž se zobrazí Nastavení, nebo ho zapínat a vypínat pomocí %@. Chcete‑li ho ukončit, otevřete Overbright znovu a v Nastavení klikněte na „Ukončit Overbright“."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan stadig åbne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight, hvor indstillingerne vises, eller bruge %@ til at slå den til eller fra. Hvis du vil slutte den, skal du åbne Overbright igen og klikke på “Slut Overbright” i indstillingerne."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst Overbright weiterhin über den Finder oder Spotlight öffnen, wodurch die Einstellungen angezeigt werden, oder es mit %@ ein- oder ausschalten. Zum Beenden öffne Overbright erneut und klicke in den Einstellungen auf „Overbright beenden“."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Μπορείτε πάντως να ανοίξετε το Overbright από το Finder ή το Spotlight, που εμφανίζει τις Ρυθμίσεις, ή να το ενεργοποιείτε και να το απενεργοποιείτε με το %@. Για τερματισμό, ανοίξτε ξανά το Overbright και κάντε κλικ στο «Τερματισμός Overbright» στις Ρυθμίσεις."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún podrás abrir Overbright desde el Finder o Spotlight, lo que muestra los ajustes, o usar %@ para activarlo o desactivarlo. Para salir, vuelve a abrir Overbright y haz clic en “Salir de Overbright” en los ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voit silti avata Overbrightin Finderista tai Spotlightista, jolloin asetukset tulevat näkyviin, tai laittaa sen päälle tai pois näppäinyhdistelmällä %@. Jos haluat lopettaa, avaa Overbright uudelleen ja klikkaa asetuksissa ”Lopeta Overbright”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez toujours ouvrir Overbright depuis le Finder ou Spotlight, ce qui affiche les réglages, ou utiliser %@ pour l’activer ou le désactiver. Pour quitter, rouvrez Overbright et cliquez sur « Quitter Overbright » dans les réglages."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright i dalje možete otvoriti iz Findera ili Spotlighta, čime se prikazuju postavke, ili ga uključiti i isključiti pomoću %@. Za zatvaranje ponovno otvorite Overbright i kliknite “Zatvori aplikaciju Overbright” u postavkama."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az Overbrightot továbbra is megnyithatja a Finderből vagy a Spotlightból – ekkor a beállítások jelennek meg –, illetve a(z) %@ billentyűparanccsal be- és kikapcsolhatja. A kilépéshez nyissa meg újra az Overbrightot, és kattintson a beállításokban a „Kilépés az Overbrightból” gombra."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Potrai comunque aprire Overbright dal Finder o da Spotlight, che mostra le impostazioni, oppure usare %@ per attivarlo o disattivarlo. Per uscire, apri di nuovo Overbright e fai clic su “Esci da Overbright” nelle impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan fortsatt åpne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight, som viser Innstillinger, eller bruke %@ for å slå den på eller av. For å avslutte åpner du Overbright igjen og klikker på «Avslutt Overbright» i Innstillinger."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je kunt Overbright nog steeds openen vanuit de Finder of Spotlight, waarna de instellingen verschijnen, of %@ gebruiken om het in of uit te schakelen. Om te stoppen, open je Overbright opnieuw en klik je op ‘Stop Overbright’ in de instellingen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nadal możesz otworzyć Overbright z Findera lub ze Spotlight – zobaczysz wtedy ustawienia – albo włączać i wyłączać go skrótem %@. Aby zakończyć, otwórz Overbright ponownie i kliknij „Zakończ Overbright” w ustawieniach."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você ainda pode abrir o Overbright pelo Finder ou pelo Spotlight, o que mostra os ajustes, ou usar %@ para ativá-lo ou desativá-lo. Para encerrar, abra o Overbright de novo e clique em “Encerrar Overbright” nos ajustes."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pode continuar a abrir o Overbright a partir do Finder ou do Spotlight, que mostra as Definições, ou usar %@ para o ativar ou desativar. Para sair, abra novamente o Overbright e clique em “Sair do Overbright” nas Definições."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puteți deschide în continuare Overbright din Finder sau Spotlight, care afișează configurările, ori puteți folosi %@ pentru a‑l activa sau dezactiva. Pentru a închide aplicația, deschideți din nou Overbright și faceți clic pe „Închideți aplicația Overbright” în configurări."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright по-прежнему можно открыть из Finder или Spotlight (откроются настройки) или включать и выключать сочетанием %@. Чтобы завершить Overbright, откройте его снова и нажмите «Завершить Overbright» в настройках."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright môžete aj naďalej otvoriť z Findera alebo zo Spotlightu, čím sa zobrazia Nastavenia, alebo ho zapínať a vypínať pomocou %@. Ak ho chcete ukončiť, znova otvorte Overbright a v Nastaveniach kliknite na „Ukončiť Overbright“."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright lahko še vedno odprete iz Finderja ali Spotlighta, kar prikaže nastavitve, ali ga vklopite in izklopite z bližnjico %@. Če ga želite zapreti, znova odprite Overbright in v nastavitvah kliknite »Zapri Overbright«."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan fortfarande öppna Overbright från Finder eller Spotlight, vilket visar inställningarna, eller använda %@ för att slå på eller stänga av den. Avsluta genom att öppna Overbright igen och klicka på ”Avsluta Overbright” i inställningarna."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright’ı yine de Finder’dan veya Spotlight’tan açarak Ayarlar’ı görebilir ya da açıp kapatmak için %@ kestirmesini kullanabilirsiniz. Çıkmak için Overbright’ı yeniden açın ve Ayarlar’daki “Overbright’tan Çık” düğmesini tıklayın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright і далі можна відкрити з Finder або Spotlight (відкриються параметри) або вмикати й вимикати скороченням %@. Щоб завершити Overbright, відкрийте його знову й клацніть «Завершити Overbright» у параметрах."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings, or use %@ to turn it on or off. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ General: text of the question before hiding the menu bar icon, without an on/off shortcut",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Encara pots obrir l’Overbright des del Finder o l’Spotlight, i se’n mostrarà la configuració. Per sortir, torna a obrir l’Overbright i fes clic a “Surt de l’Overbright” a la configuració."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright můžete dál otevřít z Finderu nebo pomocí Spotlightu, čímž se zobrazí Nastavení. Chcete‑li ho ukončit, otevřete Overbright znovu a v Nastavení klikněte na „Ukončit Overbright“."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan stadig åbne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight, hvor indstillingerne vises. Hvis du vil slutte den, skal du åbne Overbright igen og klikke på “Slut Overbright” i indstillingerne."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst Overbright weiterhin über den Finder oder Spotlight öffnen, wodurch die Einstellungen angezeigt werden. Zum Beenden öffne Overbright erneut und klicke in den Einstellungen auf „Overbright beenden“."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Μπορείτε πάντως να ανοίξετε το Overbright από το Finder ή το Spotlight, που εμφανίζει τις Ρυθμίσεις. Για τερματισμό, ανοίξτε ξανά το Overbright και κάντε κλικ στο «Τερματισμός Overbright» στις Ρυθμίσεις."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aún podrás abrir Overbright desde el Finder o Spotlight, lo que muestra los ajustes. Para salir, vuelve a abrir Overbright y haz clic en “Salir de Overbright” en los ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voit silti avata Overbrightin Finderista tai Spotlightista, jolloin asetukset tulevat näkyviin. Jos haluat lopettaa, avaa Overbright uudelleen ja klikkaa asetuksissa ”Lopeta Overbright”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez toujours ouvrir Overbright depuis le Finder ou Spotlight, ce qui affiche les réglages. Pour quitter, rouvrez Overbright et cliquez sur « Quitter Overbright » dans les réglages."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "hr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright i dalje možete otvoriti iz Findera ili Spotlighta, čime se prikazuju postavke. Za zatvaranje ponovno otvorite Overbright i kliknite “Zatvori aplikaciju Overbright” u postavkama."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Az Overbrightot továbbra is megnyithatja a Finderből vagy a Spotlightból – ekkor a beállítások jelennek meg. A kilépéshez nyissa meg újra az Overbrightot, és kattintson a beállításokban a „Kilépés az Overbrightból” gombra."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Potrai comunque aprire Overbright dal Finder o da Spotlight, che mostra le impostazioni. Per uscire, apri di nuovo Overbright e fai clic su “Esci da Overbright” nelle impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan fortsatt åpne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight, som viser Innstillinger. For å avslutte åpner du Overbright igjen og klikker på «Avslutt Overbright» i Innstillinger."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je kunt Overbright nog steeds openen vanuit de Finder of Spotlight, waarna de instellingen verschijnen. Om te stoppen, open je Overbright opnieuw en klik je op ‘Stop Overbright’ in de instellingen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nadal możesz otworzyć Overbright z Findera lub ze Spotlight – zobaczysz wtedy ustawienia. Aby zakończyć, otwórz Overbright ponownie i kliknij „Zakończ Overbright” w ustawieniach."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você ainda pode abrir o Overbright pelo Finder ou pelo Spotlight, o que mostra os ajustes. Para encerrar, abra o Overbright de novo e clique em “Encerrar Overbright” nos ajustes."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pode continuar a abrir o Overbright a partir do Finder ou do Spotlight, que mostra as Definições. Para sair, abra novamente o Overbright e clique em “Sair do Overbright” nas Definições."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puteți deschide în continuare Overbright din Finder sau Spotlight, care afișează configurările. Pentru a închide aplicația, deschideți din nou Overbright și faceți clic pe „Închideți aplicația Overbright” în configurări."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright по-прежнему можно открыть из Finder или Spotlight (откроются настройки). Чтобы завершить Overbright, откройте его снова и нажмите «Завершить Overbright» в настройках."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright môžete aj naďalej otvoriť z Findera alebo zo Spotlightu, čím sa zobrazia Nastavenia. Ak ho chcete ukončiť, znova otvorte Overbright a v Nastaveniach kliknite na „Ukončiť Overbright“."
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overbright lahko še vedno odprete iz Finderja ali Spotlighta, kar prikaže nastavitve. Če ga želite zapreti, znova odprite Overbright in v nastavitvah kliknite »Zapri Overbright«."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan fortfarande öppna Overbright från Finder eller Spotlight, vilket visar inställningarna. Avsluta genom att öppna Overbright igen och klicka på ”Avsluta Overbright” i inställningarna."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "You can still open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight, which shows Settings. To quit, open Overbright again and click Quit Overbright in Settings."
          }
