    "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still use %@, or open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight." : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ General: explanation of the icon warning; the placeholder is the live key caps of the on/off shortcut",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS may be hiding it, or the menu bar is too full to show it. You can still use %@, or open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pot ser que el macOS l’amagui o que la barra de menús sigui massa plena per mostrar‑la. Encara pots fer servir %@ o obrir l’Overbright des del Finder o l’Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Možná ji skrývá macOS nebo je řádek nabídek příliš zaplněný. I nadále můžete použít %@ nebo Overbright otevřít z Finderu či pomocí Spotlightu."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS skjuler det måske, eller også er der ikke plads til det på menulinjen. Du kan stadig bruge %@ eller åbne Overbright fra Finder eller Spotlight."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
